# InvenTree LCSC Auto Import Plugin

This repository contains a small installable InvenTree plugin for importing and scanning LCSC parts automatically.

## Overview

The plugin is designed to work with LCSC-compatible JSON payloads and scans in a way that keeps the LCSC identifier (`pc` / SKU) as the canonical part key while still allowing InvenTree to manage the final inventory record.

## Install

```bash
pip install inventree-plugin-lcsc-autoimport
```

Or from source:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/isosloth/inventree-plugin-lcsc-autoimport.git
cd inventree-plugin-lcsc-autoimport
pip install -e .
```

Then enable the plugin in the InvenTree admin/plugin settings UI.

## Common configuration

Configure this plugin with:

- the LCSC supplier company record
- the product fetch URL
- optional API key
- default fallback category path
- category mapping JSON
- fetch toggle

## Sample API request

```bash
curl -X POST \
  -H "Authorization: Token <your-inventree-token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  http://localhost:8000/api/plugin/lcsc-autoimport/bulk/ \
  -d '{
    "items": [
      {"sku": "C312270"},
      {"sku": "C0402C104K5RACTU"}
    ]
  }'
```

## Example scan

The plugin recognizes LCSC QR payloads with fields like `pc:C312270` and imports them on demand if they are not already in InvenTree.

